From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:42:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] sdk: reuse owned JSON values and object syscall
 arguments

Decode freshly parsed internal SDK results in place, including bulk collections and pagination, while keeping the public converter copy contract. Preserve tagged values and own __proto__ fields.

Use an optional object-argument syscall hook when the runtime provides it. Other runtimes retain the existing JSON-string syscall contract.
